      GrowthForge<span class="brand-dot">.</span>
    </div>

    <p>
      SEO, paid acquisition and conversion systems built around measurable growth.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-links">
    <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">Email</a>
    <a href={`${home}#services`}>Services</a>
    <a href={`${home}#work`}>Case studies</a>
    <a href={`${home}#tools`}>Free tools</a>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
